00:08:52.942 --> 00:08:54.911
REPUBLICAN COMMITTEES LOOKING

00:08:54.044 --> 00:08:57.947
INTO THIS BECAUSE THEY'RE

00:08:55.045 --> 00:09:00.850
ARGUING THAT, OH, YOU GUYS ARE

00:08:58.081 --> 00:09:04.287
JUST INTERFERING WITH WHAT THE

00:09:00.984 --> 00:09:05.155
SPECIAL COUNCIL IS TRYING TO GET

00:09:04.421 --> 00:09:06.990
AT.

00:09:05.288 --> 00:09:08.792
INDICTMENTS COME OUT TODAY.

00:09:07.123 --> 00:09:09.225
WHAT'S NEXT FOR THE HOUSE

00:09:08.925 --> 00:09:10.060
INVESTIGATION?

00:09:09.359 --> 00:09:13.229
&gt;&gt;  IT'S GOING TO CONTINUE.

00:09:10.193 --> 00:09:19.169
THE STATE DEPARTMENT IS NEXT

00:09:13.363 --> 00:09:22.072
KIND OF UNDER THE MICROSCOPE.

00:09:19.302 --> 00:09:24.507
AND WE'RE GOING TO SCRUTINIZE

00:09:22.205 --> 00:09:25.742
PEOPLE LIKE JOHN BRENNAN AND SEE

00:09:24.641 --> 00:09:27.010
THEIR ROLE IN THIS.

00:09:25.876 --> 00:09:29.713
SIX MONTHS AGO, PEOPLE DIDN'T

00:09:27.143 --> 00:09:30.046
KNOW THE DEMOCRATS PAID FOR THE

00:09:29.846 --> 00:09:32.115
DOSSIER.

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:34.151
YOU HAVE A LOT OF SENIOR PEOPLE

00:09:32.249 --> 00:09:36.019
IN THE DOJ OR FBI EITHER GET

00:09:34.284 --> 00:09:38.255
DEMOTED OR LEAVE THE GOVERNMENT.

00:09:36.153 --> 00:09:40.791
THEY WOULDN'T HAVE DONE THAT IF

00:09:38.388 --> 00:09:41.091
THEY HAD DONE EVERYTHING BY THE

00:09:40.924 --> 00:09:43.160
BOOK.

00:09:41.224 --> 00:09:43.627
&gt;&gt;  BRENNAN SENT OUT A TWEET

00:09:43.293 --> 00:09:48.365
TODAY.

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:49.566
HE SAID DOJ STATEMENT AND

00:09:48.498 --> 00:09:48.782
INDICTMENTS

00:09:48.782 --> 00:09:50.901
INDICTMENT

00:09:49.699 --> 00:09:55.706
INDICTMENTS, CLAIMS OF A HOAX.

00:09:51.034 --> 00:09:57.407
MY TAKE, IMPLAUSIBLE THAT

00:09:55.839 --> 00:09:59.409
RUSSIAN ACTIONS DID NOT

00:09:57.541 --> 00:10:00.777
INFLUENCE THE VIEWS AND VOTES OF

00:09:59.543 --> 00:10:01.445
AT LEAST SOME AMERICANS.

00:10:00.911 --> 00:10:03.213
OKAY, I GUESS.

00:10:01.578 --> 00:10:04.915
BUT HOW DOES THAT JUSTIFY A

00:10:03.347 --> 00:10:06.817
SPECIAL COUNCIL BEING CALLED ON

00:10:05.048 --> 00:10:07.851
THIS PRESIDENT?

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:10.087
BUT WHEN ROSENSTEIN PICKED THE

00:10:07.985 --> 00:10:11.455
SPECIAL COUNCIL, SAID WE'VE GOT

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:13.090
TO DO THE SPECIAL COUNCIL, THAT

00:10:11.588 --> 00:10:15.492
WAS BASED ON WHAT?

00:10:13.223 --> 00:10:17.828
I GO BACK TO ROD'S DECISION TO

00:10:15.626 --> 00:10:19.730
CALL THE SPECIAL COUNCIL, WHICH

00:10:17.961 --> 00:10:21.064
I THINK WAS ABSURD ON ITS FACE.

00:10:19.863 --> 00:10:23.467
YOU CAN CLOSE IT OUT.

00:10:21.198 --> 00:10:24.434
&gt;&gt;  I DISAGREE.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:27.971
I THINK IT ABSOLUTELY IS CALLED

00:10:24.568 --> 00:10:29.273
FOR BY THE REGULATION, JUST LIKE

00:10:28.105 --> 00:10:32.209
PRESIDENT OBAMA SHOULD HAVE

00:10:29.406 --> 00:10:34.645
APPOINTED A SPECIAL COUNCIL.

00:10:32.342 --> 00:10:37.314
THE POINT IS YOU CAN'T HAVE THE

00:10:34.778 --> 00:10:38.716
ADMINISTRATION THAT HAS BEEN

00:10:37.448 --> 00:10:39.316
ACCUSED OF THROWING AN ELECTION

00:10:38.849 --> 00:10:41.051
INVESTIGATING ITSELF.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.785
IF YOU LOOK AT --

00:10:41.185 --> 00:10:46.590
&gt;&gt;WHAT WAS THE PROBABLE CAUSE

00:10:41.919 --> 00:10:48.926
OR ANY INDICATION THAT A CRIME

00:10:46.724 --> 00:10:49.627
HAD BEEN COMMITTED?

00:10:49.059 --> 00:10:50.794
&gt;&gt;  YOU DON'T HAVE TO HAVE

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:51.695
PROBABLE CAUSE UNDER THE

00:10:50.928 --> 00:10:53.998
REGULATION.

00:10:51.829 --> 00:10:55.433
AND, LOOK, I THINK THAT LORETTA

00:10:54.131 --> 00:10:57.034
LYNCH SHOULD HAVE APPOINTED A

00:10:55.566 --> 00:10:57.735
SPECIAL COUNCIL BECAUSE OF THE

00:10:57.168 --> 00:10:59.370
HILLARY CLINTON EMAIL THING.

00:10:57.868 --> 00:11:00.638
YOU DON'T HAVE TO, BUT THE POINT

00:10:59.503 --> 00:11:02.573
IS THE LANGUAGE OF THE SPECIAL

00:11:00.771 --> 00:11:03.274
COUNCIL REGULATION ALLOWS YOU TO

00:11:02.707 --> 00:11:05.009
DO IT.

00:11:03.407 --> 00:11:07.178
&gt;&gt;  YOU CAN DO A LOT.

00:11:05.142 --> 00:11:09.013
IT DOESN'T MEAN YOU SHOULD.

00:11:07.311 --> 00:11:10.514
RON, YOUR TAKE AND THEN SCOTT

00:11:09.146 --> 00:11:11.849
AND THEN WE'VE GOT TO GO.

00:11:10.648 --> 00:11:13.517
&gt;&gt;  ROD ROSENSTEIN IN THE

00:11:11.983 --> 00:11:15.720
APPOINTING ORDER DID NOT

00:11:13.651 --> 00:11:16.153
IDENTIFY THE CRIME TO BE

00:11:15.853 --> 00:11:18.956
INVESTIGATED.

00:11:16.287 --> 00:11:19.523
HE SAID, INVESTIGATE COMEY'S

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:19.957
COUNTERINTELLIGENCE

00:11:19.657 --> 00:11:22.059
INVESTIGATION.

00:11:20.091 --> 00:11:23.628
THE REGULATIONS ONLY ALLOW FOR A

00:11:22.193 --> 00:11:24.061
SPECIAL COUNCIL FOR A CRIMINAL

00:11:23.761 --> 00:11:25.596
INVESTIGATION.

00:11:24.195 --> 00:11:27.698
HE DID NOT DO THAT, AND THAT'S

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:28.566
WHY A LOT OF US HAVE BEEN

00:11:27.832 --> 00:11:31.235
CONCERNED THIS INVESTIGATION

00:11:28.699 --> 00:11:32.937
DIDN'T HAVE ANY REAL LIMITS.

00:11:31.369 --> 00:11:35.973
&gt;&gt;  THAT'S NOT ACCURATE.

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:36.274
&gt;&gt;  OKAY.

00:11:36.107 --> 00:11:37.375
SCOTT.

00:11:36.407 --> 00:11:38.209
&gt;&gt;  INVESTIGATING RUSSIAN

00:11:37.508 --> 00:11:39.977
MEDDLING IN THE ELECTION.

